Package: com.coteyka.artistfix
Name: ArtistFix
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Splits multi-artist tags like "Artist 1; Artist 2" into separate artists in the stock iOS 6 Music app.
Maintainer: coteyka
Author: coteyka
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
